## Why This Is Asked
Tests practical CKNE-to-quotas mapping, token-based fairness, and SLA guarantees in a real-world multi-tenant dispatch scenario.

## Key Concepts
- CKNE-to-quotas mapping
- Token-bucket with a global minute cap
- Minute-by-minute reallocation and carryover
- SLA baseline with priority to high-CKNE tenants

## Code Example
```javascript
function allocateQuotas(totalCap, tenants) {
  const sumCKNE = tenants.reduce((s,t)=>s+t.ckne,0) || 1;
  return tenants.map(t => {
    const q = Math.floor(totalCap * (t.ckne / sumCKNE));
    return {tenant: t.tenant, quota: Math.max(1, q)};
  });
}
```

## Follow-up Questions
